  "notes": "FORMS:\n- Adverbial: おっかなく (rare)\n- Noun form: おっかなさ\n\n- Negative: おっかなくない\n- Te-form: おっかなくて\n- Past: おっかなかった\n\nUSAGE:\nA colloquial synonym of {怖|こわ}い. Originally a Kanto (eastern Japan) dialect word, it is widely understood throughout Japan but retains a casual, slightly rough tone. More common in spoken language than in writing.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- おっかなびっくり — fearfully, timidly (doing something while scared)",
